[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7142.87, "timestamp": "01:59:02", "text": "是的。如果你要去的话，那就没问题。得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7145.03, "timestamp": "01:59:05", "text": "玛萨拉。好的。带上玛萨拉香料。得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7148.39, "timestamp": "01:59:08", "text": "把香料带上你。好的。日本人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7150.149, "timestamp": "01:59:10", "text": "咖喱是我吃过最难吃的咖喱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7152.07, "timestamp": "01:59:12", "text": "曾经尝试过。好的。不要像……一样吃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7153.75, "timestamp": "01:59:13", "text": "那。你尝尝吧。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7156.709, "timestamp": "01:59:16", "text": "这是我吃过最难吃的咖喱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7160.709, "timestamp": "01:59:20", "text": "我听说生食或加工食品是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7162.79, "timestamp": "01:59:22", "text": "机场之类的地方不允许。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7164.709, "timestamp": "01:59:24", "text": "没有把握。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7168.149, "timestamp": "01:59:28", "text": "但加点玛萨拉香料应该没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7171.51, "timestamp": "01:59:31", "text": "我希望如此。我试着看看你是否愿意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7173.91, "timestamp": "01:59:33", "text": "给你的……加点香料"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7175.02, "timestamp": "01:59:35", "text": "行李。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7176.709, "timestamp": "01:59:36", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7178.47, "timestamp": "01:59:38", "text": "因为它只是粉末状的东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7180.79, "timestamp": "01:59:40", "text": "是的。姜黄。剩下的东西你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7182.39, "timestamp": "01:59:42", "text": "我会收到的。但也许像姜黄和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7184.47, "timestamp": "01:59:44", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7186.79, "timestamp": "01:59:46", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7189.189, "timestamp": "01:59:49", "text": "是的，甚至包括我所在的公司。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7192.87, "timestamp": "01:59:52", "text": "有像印度香料一样的印度香料，呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7194.47, "timestamp": "01:59:54", "text": 